> > > One other solution that can tick at least a lot of those boxes is to use facets.:
> > >
> > > Data2 <- tidyr::gather(Data, 'var', 'val', -Depth, -Station)
> > > ggplot(Data2,aes(x=val,y=Depth,colour=Station))+
> > >   geom_point()+
> > >   geom_path()+
> > >   facet_wrap(~var, scales = "free") +
> > >   xlim(0, 42) +
